  "body": "Add ColorInterpolationMethod, HueInterpolationMethod and premultiplyAlpha attributes to CanvasGradient.\n\n- [X] At least two implementers are interested (and none opposed):\n   * [Chromium](https://groups.google.com/u/2/a/chromium.org/g/blink-dev/c/6PhsIK2kxeM)\n   * [Webkit](https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/7947) \n\n- [X] [Tests](https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/6226021) are written and can be reviewed and commented upon.\n\n- [ ] [Implementation bugs](https://github.com/whatwg/meta/blob/main/MAINTAINERS.md#handling-pull-requests) are filed:\n   * [Chromium](https://issues.chromium.org/issues/394052224)\n   * Gecko: …\n   * WebKit: …\n- [ ] Corresponding [HTML AAM](https://w3c.github.io/html-aam/) & [ARIA in HTML](https://w3c.github.io/html-aria/) issues & PRs:\n- [ ] [MDN issue](https://github.com/whatwg/meta/blob/main/MAINTAINERS.md#handling-pull-requests) is filed: …\n- [X] The top of this comment includes a [clear commit message](https://github.com/whatwg/meta/blob/main/COMMITTING.md) to use. <!-- If you created this PR from a single commit, Github copied its message. Otherwise, you need to add a commit message yourself. -->\n\nOpen questions:\n - Should we add an \"options\" object at the end, to specify these attributes at creation? (Method 2 in https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/8296)\n - Do we expose color stops, while we're at it?\n\nTODO:\n- [x] Lint\n- [ ] Mozilla/Apple stances, bugs\n- [x] Experimental implementation in Chromium\n- [x] WPT tests\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programmatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/10986/canvas.html\" title=\"Last updated on Feb 24, 2025, 4:23 PM UTC (e9e20c0)\">/canvas.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/10986/005b463...e9e20c0/canvas.html\" title=\"Last updated on Feb 24, 2025, 4:23 PM UTC (e9e20c0)\">diff</a> )",
